# Installed from the public registry, which the VDI can reach through
# gmproxy.kfs.local:8080 (measured 2026-10-07, see docs/E2E-CERCEVE-DEGERLENDIRME.md).
#
# The BUILD OUTPUT used to be committed so the VDI could run the jar without
# npm. It no longer is — ../resources/static/ui is ignored by the ROOT
# .gitignore, which carries the reasoning and the one-time `git rm --cached`
# this needed. Consequence worth repeating here, next to the thing that
# produces it: `npm run build` must run BEFORE `mvn install`, or the jar ships
# without a UI.
node_modules/
